{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:0.2"], "en": "The Chapter on the Giver of a Tuvara Fruit, 6.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:0.3"], "en": "The Apadāna of the Elder Pattadāyaka (The Giver of the Alms-Bowl)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:1.1"], "en": "“With supreme self-control,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:1.2", "PA_tha-ap_248:1.3"], "en": "I gave an alms-bowl to Siddhattha, the Great Sage.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:1.4"], "en": "To him who had become upright and steadfast;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:2.1", "PA_tha-ap_248:2.2"], "en": "that gift which I gave at that time, ninety-four aeons ago—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:2.3"], "en": "I do not know a state of woe;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:2.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of giving alms bowls.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:3.1"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:3.2"], "en": "\"...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:3.3"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been fulfilled.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:4.1"], "en": "Thus indeed did the venerable elder Pattadāyaka speak these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_248:5.1"], "en": "The legend of the Elder Pattadāyaka is the sixth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"}
]
